A||||1||sully5||FDNY memorial service||||1||
Z||000000||sully5||10-30-2001||09:48 PM||||Just in case anyone is interested, there is going to be a memorial service on November 18 for those members of the FDNY lost at the WTC. I just want to personally thank all of you that have gone out of your way to show your appreciation of the fire departments, and police departments, in your areas. It really means a lot to those who do those jobs. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||fogglethorpe||10-31-2001||09:23 AM||||I do not have to put myself in harm's way on a regular basis; the reason for that is because there are other people who do.<P>I do appreciate the bravery and commitment of police officers, fire fighters, and our military personnel.<P>I can not imagine running into a burning building, while others are running out...or being shot at, or sent into a desolate place, far away and unfamiliar, to fight an unknown enemy...<P>So, if you are one of those people, know that you ARE appreciated.||||reg||1
